From: Fei Shao <fshao@chromium.org>
Date: Thu, 14 Mar 2024 23:36:19 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] TEST-ONLY: Himax touchscreen driver squash

Himax touchsreen driver squash. This is created with:
- reverting the old WIP Himax drivers
- applying non-driver CLs CL:5369477, CL:5362457, CL:5362458, CL:5362459
- applying CL chains ended at CL:5326109 PS#4

as a temporary solution because the Geralt ToT is under rebasing and
being unstable.

Delete this squash once we can update Geralt ToT with the latest
version.

